entries.answer:
Az alábbi konfigurációval tudod használni a **Vale**, **V (vlang)** és **HVM** programnyelveket Replit-en Nix flake-kel:

**.replit:**
```
run = "nix run"
entrypoint = "flake.nix"
modules = ["nix"]

[nix]
channel = "stable-24_05"

[agent]
expertMode = true
```

**replit.nix:**
```nix
{ pkgs }:
{
  deps = [
    pkgs.vlang
    pkgs.git
    pkgs.gcc
    pkgs.clang
    pkgs.llvm
  ];
}
```

**flake.nix:**
```nix
{
  inputs = {
    nixpkgs.url = "nixpkgs";
    utils.url = "github:numtide/flake-utils";
  };

  outputs = { self, nixpkgs, utils }:
    utils.lib.eachDefaultSystem (system:
      let
        pkgs = nixpkgs.legacyPackages.${system};

        vale = pkgs.stdenv.mkDerivation {
          pname = "vale";
          version = "dev";
          src = pkgs.fetchFromGitHub {
            owner = "ValeLang";
            repo = "Vale";
            rev = "master";
            sha256 = "sha256-AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=";
          };
          buildInputs = [ pkgs.llvm pkgs.cmake ];
        };

        hvm = pkgs.fetchFromGitHub {
          owner = "HigherOrderCO";
          repo = "HVM";
          rev = "main";
          sha256 = "sha256-AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=";
        };

      in
      {
        packages.default = pkgs.stdenv.mkDerivation {
          pname = "multi-lang-env";
          version = "0.0.1";
          src = ./.;

          buildInputs = [
            pkgs.vlang
            pkgs.clang
            pkgs.llvm
            pkgs.git
            pkgs.rustc
            pkgs.cargo
          ];

          shellHook = ''
            export PATH=$PATH:${hvm}
          '';

          installPhase = ''
            mkdir -p $out/bin
            echo "#!/usr/bin/env bash" > $out/bin/run
            echo "echo 'Vale, V, HVM environment ready'" >> $out/bin/run
            chmod +x $out/bin/run
          '';
        };

        devShells.default = pkgs.mkShell {
          buildInputs = [
            pkgs.vlang
            pkgs.clang
            pkgs.llvm
            pkgs.git
          ];
        };
      }
    );
}
```

**default.nix:**
```nix
{ stdenv, vlang, clang, llvm, git }:
stdenv.mkDerivation {
  pname = "vale-v-hvm-env";
  version = "0.0.1";

  src = [ ./. ];

  buildInputs = [ vlang clang llvm git ];

  installPhase = ''
    mkdir -p $out/bin
    echo "#!/usr/bin/env bash" > $out/bin/run
    echo "v version" >> $out/bin/run
    chmod +x $out/bin/run
    install -D $out/bin/run $out/bin/run
  '';
}
```

A **V (vlang)** közvetlenül elérhető a nixpkgs-ből `pkgs.vlang` néven. A **Vale** és **HVM** esetében GitHub-ról kell fetchelni, mivel nem standard csomagok. A konfiguráció LLVM-et és Clang-ot tartalmaz build támogatáshoz.[1][5][6][10]

